            "review_text": "Alastair R\n4 contributions\n0\nGreat experience at genuine Vietnamese beach front restaurant\nDec 2024 • Couples\nThe service (friendly and quick), and the quality and value of the dishes, was very good. We checked the place out late afternoon, had a friendly guy greet us; once we’d looked to the menus, we booked a table on the water front for later that evening. The table was held for us, and the squid and seafood fried rice were wonderful. NB There is more than one Mr Crab - this one is at 112 on the main Mui Ne road\nRead more\nWritten December 23, 2024",
