            "review_title": "Review at Bờ Kè Mr. Crab",
            "review_text": "HARRY1957\nHardisty, Canada117 contributions\n0\nbờ kè Mr. crab for the win!\nApr 2024 • Couples\nOur cab driver recommended bờ kè Mr. crab to us, and we were thankful. \nMy partner and I had excellent meals at bờ kè Mr. crab. I had seafood fried rice. My partner had pork fried rice. We shared BBQ prawns and vegetable soup with Boc Choy. We both enjoyed our fried rice that had fresh vegetables, eggs, and protein. The prawns were tender and sweet with the subtle hint of char. The soup was tasty and fresh. The view at the side of the South China Sea was beautiful. A large tree shaded us from the sun's rays. The staff was attentive and pleasant.\nRead more\nWritten April 6, 2024",
